        <mxCell id="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-86" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Commercial building – LV distribution&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;DSO 20 kV supply (S&quot;k max/min 350/250 MVA) via 1.5 km cable to the building ring main unit.&lt;br&gt;Two 1 MVA Dyn5 transformers feed main switchboards A and B (bus coupler normally open).&lt;br&gt;Sub-distribution boards: floors, kitchen, data room, EV parking (6x22 kW) and 150 kWp rooftop PV.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Try:&lt;/b&gt; Load Flow – voltage drop at the boards, transformer loading;&lt;br&gt;Short Circuit IEC 60909 – three-phase and single-phase (TN system) fault currents for breaker&lt;br&gt;and protective-device selection; close the bus coupler to see the fault level rise." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#81c784;" vertex="1" parent="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-1">
